            "id": 127106,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametre, bir değeri depolayan değişken gibi davranır. Ancak henüz içinde bir değer yok.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, \\(name)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name: String</code>, ardından <code>name</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
