            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametreye bir değer geçirmek için fonksiyonu çağırırken değeri parantezlerin arasına yerleştiririz; tıpkı burada <code>greet(name: \"Anna\")</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Anna\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greet</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>name:</code>, <code>\"Anna\"</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
